  "title": "对新闻工作的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-348.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>348)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　新闻单位要树立严肃作风、科学作风、战斗作风，要培养无产阶级革命者的战斗风格。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（据陈伯达同志1967年9月3日对新闻人员讲话时传达）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-347.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-349.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
